1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,400
Now, some people think the members of the GOP caucus aren't interested in anything logical.

2
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:10,540
They just want to see the world burn, as Alfred Pennyworth put it in The Dark Knight.

3
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,700
But I see a method in the madness.

4
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:17,800
A week ago, Donald Trump posted a comment saying that a government shutdown, quote,

5
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:25,180
is the last chance to defund these political prosecutions against me and other patriots.

6
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:26,140
You get it?

7
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:34,160
To delay justice, Donald Trump would cut off paychecks to a couple million service members and federal workers

8
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:40,560
and furlough more than a million workers and pay them later for having not worked.

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:46,600
They would halt food assistance to millions of moms and kids and keep NIH and my district

10
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:51,180
from enrolling any more patients in life-and-death clinical research trials.

11
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:57,380
Trump's convinced that if we shut the government down, his four criminal prosecutions on 91 different

12
00:00:57,380 --> 00:01:03,880
felony and misdemeanor charges will be defunded and delayed long enough to keep him from having

13
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:07,760
to go before a jury of his peers before the 2024 election.

14
00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:12,240
And like flying monkeys on a mission for the Wicked Witch of the West, Trump's followers

15
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:17,200
in the House now carry his messages out to the world, shut down the government, shut down

16
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,200
the prosecutions.

17
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:22,400
But the cult master has another command for his followers, which brings us here today.

18
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:25,000
On August 27th, he posted this edict.

19
00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:28,580
Either impeach the bum or fade into oblivion.

20
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:30,140
They did it to us.

